{"body": [{"y0": 66.2, "x0": 68.9, "x1": 247.3, "text": "Versiculós in mé naàrrátur scribere Cinna."}, {"y0": 84.2, "x0": 78.6, "x1": 262.4, "text": "Non scribit, cutus carmina nemó legit! —"}, {"y0": 102.2, "x0": 67.6, "x1": 264.0, "text": "Nil recitàás — et vis, Màmerce, poeta viden."}, {"y0": 120.5, "x0": 38.7, "x1": 268.3, "text": "175 Quidquid vis, esto — dummodo nil recites!"}, {"y0": 138.7, "x0": 68.4, "x1": 311.5, "text": "Ecce alia epigrammata Martialis quae Cornelius con-"}, {"y0": 157.2, "x0": 56.8, "x1": 225.5, "text": "vivis attentis atque delectàtis recitat:"}, {"y0": 175.1, "x0": 67.6, "x1": 270.7, "text": "Non amó t£, Sabidi, nec possum dicere quàáre."}, {"y0": 193.4, "x0": 78.8, "x1": 269.2, "text": "Hoc tantum possum dicere: nón amó te! —"}, {"y0": 211.1, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 268.3, "text": "180 — Nil mihi dàs vivus, dicis \"post fata datürum.'"}, {"y0": 230.0, "x0": 78.8, "x1": 284.5, "text": "$1 nón es stultus, scis, Maró, quid cupiam! —"}, {"y0": 248.1, "x0": 69.3, "x1": 283.3, "text": "\"Esse nihil dicis, quidquid petis, improbe Cinna."}, {"y0": 266.1, "x0": 78.8, "x1": 281.5, "text": "$1 nil, Cinna, petis, nil tibi, Cinna, nego! —"}, {"y0": 284.3, "x0": 67.8, "x1": 276.3, "text": "Nesció tam multis quid scribas, Fauste, puellis."}, {"y0": 302.9, "x0": 37.8, "x1": 252.0, "text": "185 Hoc sció: quod scribit nülla puella tibi!"}, {"y0": 320.9, "x0": 68.5, "x1": 311.5, "text": "Sequuntur epigrammata quibus déridentur feminae,"}, {"y0": 339.0, "x0": 57.2, "x1": 231.6, "text": "praecipue anüs, ut Laecània et Paula:"}, {"y0": 357.2, "x0": 68.7, "x1": 259.5, "text": "Thais habet nigros, niveos Laecània dentes."}, {"y0": 373.8, "x0": 79.2, "x1": 294.4, "text": "Quae ratio est? Émptós haec habet, illa suos! —"}, {"y0": 393.2, "x0": 37.8, "x1": 266.5, "text": "190 — Nübere vis Prisco; nón miror, Paula, sapisti."}, {"y0": 411.9, "x0": 78.8, "x1": 270.0, "text": "Dücere té nón vult Priscus: et ille sapit! —"}, {"y0": 430.1, "x0": 67.6, "x1": 271.4, "text": "Nübere Paula cupit nobis, ego ducere Paulam"}, {"y0": 448.5, "x0": 79.0, "x1": 262.8, "text": "nolo: anus est; vellem si magis esset anus!"}, {"y0": 466.8, "x0": 68.0, "x1": 311.7, "text": "Ceteris ridentibus \"Quid ridétis?\" inquit Paula,"}, {"y0": 484.8, "x0": 37.8, "x1": 311.5, "text": "195 *Num haec in mé, uxorem formosam atque puellam,"}, {"y0": 503.0, "x0": 57.4, "x1": 154.0, "text": "scripta esse putatis?\""}, {"y0": 521.0, "x0": 68.2, "x1": 311.9, "text": "Cornelius: Minime, Paula. Nec scilicet in té, sed in"}, {"y0": 539.9, "x0": 57.2, "x1": 175.3, "text": "Bassam scriptum est hoc:"}], "margin": [{"y0": 69.0, "x0": 325.4, "x1": 409.3, "text": "versiculus -i m — versus"}, {"y0": 78.0, "x0": 329.7, "x1": 358.7, "text": "(parvus)"}, {"y0": 87.4, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 370.0, "text": "nón scribit is"}, {"y0": 104.1, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 361.4, "text": "nil — nihil"}, {"y0": 141.0, "x0": 325.7, "x1": 399.4, "text": "[/.32; X1.67; II1.61;"}, {"y0": 149.9, "x0": 328.6, "x1": 353.1, "text": "XI.64]"}, {"y0": 177.0, "x0": 325.2, "x1": 370.4, "text": "Sabidius -i tm"}, {"y0": 213.6, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 377.6, "text": "té datürum esse"}, {"y0": 222.8, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 404.2, "text": "fata : fatum (: mortem)"}, {"y0": 231.9, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 371.5, "text": "Maró -ónis m"}, {"y0": 249.9, "x0": 324.7, "x1": 406.9, "text": "à mé petis (— mé rogas)"}, {"y0": 258.9, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 366.4, "text": "Cinna -ae m"}, {"y0": 277.1, "x0": 325.2, "x1": 367.9, "text": "Faustus -17"}, {"y0": 286.3, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 411.1, "text": "tam multis puellis (7 tot"}, {"y0": 295.5, "x0": 329.3, "x1": 355.1, "text": "puellis)"}, {"y0": 304.7, "x0": 321.6, "x1": 362.5, "text": "E *te amo\"!"}, {"y0": 322.7, "x0": 325.4, "x1": 386.8, "text": "[V.43; IX.5; X.8]"}, {"y0": 341.0, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 414.1, "text": "anus -üs f — femina vetus"}, {"y0": 350.0, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 368.4, "text": "Thàis -idis f"}, {"y0": 359.2, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 400.6, "text": "niveus -a -um (« nix)"}, {"y0": 368.4, "x